    "chunk_text": "DOMINICA PASCHA. Men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feis eastorlice geryno us \u00e6teowe\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s ecean lifes sweotole bysene, swa we nu gehyran Him bi\u00fe beforan andweard eal engla cynn & manna cynn, & eac swylce werigra gasta. & \u00fe\u00e6r beo\u00f0 asmeade \u00e6ghwylces mannes d\u00e6da. & se \u00fee nu bi\u00fe ea\u00femod & gemyndig Drihtnes \u00ferowunge & his \u00e6riste ealle mode, se sceal heofonlicre & se \u00fee nu forhoga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes bebodu healde, o\u00fe\u00fee \u00e6nig gemynd h\u00e6bbe Drihtnes ea\u00femodnesse, se \u00deonne is \u00feeos tid ealra tida hehst & halgost, & on \u00feas tid we sceolan habban godcunde blisse & eac Swa se witga Dauid be \u00feisse tide witgade, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Ure Drihten us gefreolsode. & he geendode \u00fe\u00e6t he lange to \u00fe\u00e6m awergdum gastum gebeotod h\u00e6fde, & he mannum gecy\u00fede on \u00feas Uuton nu gehyran & ge\u00feencean hw\u00e6t he dyde, & mid hwy he us freo gedyde. N\u00e6s he mid n\u00e6nigum nede geb\u00e6ded, ac he mid his sylfes willan to eor\u00fean astag, & her manige setunga & \u00fea \u00e6t nehstan he let his lichoman on rode mid n\u00e6glum gef\u00e6stnian, & dea\u00fe he ge\u00ferowode for us, & he \u00fea onsende his \u00feone wuldorf\u00e6stan gast to helle grunde, & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feone ealdor ealra \u00feeostra & \u00fe\u00e6s Hie \u00fea swi\u00fee forhte & abregde \u00feus cw\u00e6don: Hwonon is",
